meta {
  name: Live instance logs
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/status-logs-stream?source={{logSourceId}}&tail=10000
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Run the Instance log sources request first, then run this individually and stop it manually.
  Streams application output as written, with terminal controls removed; it may contain sensitive text.
  Log retention is limited to 10000 lines / 8 MiB of text and 16 KiB per line.
  After an instance restart, discover its sources again.
  See https://slimfaas.dev/user-interface#instance-logs.
}
